/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Each percept removes physical states inconsistent with the observed location and dirt status, so the belief state shrinks. In the sensorless case, no percepts are available, so uncertainty remains and actions must work for every possible physical state. The sensorless plan is still rational because it guarantees that all possible states reach a clean configuration, maximizing the expected/guaranteed performance given the available information.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
